"description":"Say hello to My StudyStream – the ultimate focus app designed to elevate your productivity and make studying an immersive, enjoyable experience.\n\nKey Features\nCustomizable Study Timers: Set personalized timers to align with your study sessions, and watch the soothing ocean animation in the background as time slips away.\nImmersive Ocean Animation: Immerse yourself in the calming visuals of the ocean while you study. With the gentle flow of the waves, you can stay focused and engaged while working.\nInteractive Background: With StudyStream, you have the power to interact with the ocean animation – drag it, tap it, and let the tranquil beauty of the sea transport you to a place of serenity, even during the most intense study sessions.\nDistraction-Free Environment: Say goodbye to interruptions and distractions. StudyStream creates a serene and focused atmosphere, allowing you to immerse yourself in your studies without the disruptions of daily life.\nEnhanced Focus and Productivity: Experience a new level of concentration and productivity as you lose yourself in the mesmerizing ocean background. The soothing visuals and customizable study timers help you stay on track and achieve your study goals with ease.", "minimumOsVersion":"17.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"12780544", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1, "trackContentRating":"4+", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "userRatingCount":1}, 
